WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:20.000
[音乐] 大钟寺钟声:五记低沉钟鸣于持续低音之上,渐密
[Music] Dazhongsi bells: five deep strikes over a quiet drone, quickening

00:20.000 --> 00:54.000
[音乐] 轨道节奏进入,五声音阶在C宫逐步爬升,和弦垫 C6/9-Am7-Gsus2-C6/9 与低音声部在下方支撑
[Music] Rail rhythm enters; a pentatonic motif climbs step by step in C gong, over a C6/9-Am7-Gsus2-C6/9 pad and bass line

00:54.000 --> 01:02.000
[音乐] 折返:旋律退两步,和声转暗(Am7),停顿
[Music] The switchback: the motif steps back, the harmony darkens (Am7), then pauses

01:02.000 --> 01:28.000
[音乐] 转调再爬升——由C宫整体移至D宫(以调性升高表达"爬得更高",而非单纯拔高音区),对位声部于74秒低八度加入
[Music] The climb resumes a whole step up, modulating from C gong to D gong — the "higher" is a key change, not raw pitch — with a counter-line joining an octave below at 0:74

01:28.000 --> 01:40.000
[音乐] 登顶:高低编钟以八度加五度合鸣,暖色渐弱收束
[Music] Summit: high and low chimes together in octave and fifth, a warm fade to close

NOTE
纯器乐,无人声。全曲为代码加法合成(钟形非谐泛音列),无采样。旋律基频封顶约660Hz,全局约3.2kHz滚降并经软限幅,避免高频刺耳。
Instrumental only, no speech. Entirely code-synthesized (inharmonic bell partials), no samples. The melody fundamental is capped at about 660 Hz, with a global roll-off near 3.2 kHz and a soft limiter to avoid harshness.
